WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:02.890
So, have you got it?

00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:05.560
You don't waste any time, huh?

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.520
Got it right here.

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:11.990
So you do. I owe you one, old friend.

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.200
I knew you'd have just the thing.

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:17.370
At least let me thank you with this.

00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:19.200
Uh... I think I'll pass.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.580
Oh, please.

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.750
No, really.

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:25.630
Anyway, if you've got what you need, it's time I headed back.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.790
Wh-What is that?

00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:28.960
A-A turtle?!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:32.380
Yes, yes, please excuse me.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:36.010
<i>What's she up to this time?</i>

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:18.070
A package? Wonder what it is.

00:02:19.780 --> 00:02:21.030
Maybe it's from Suwano?

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:26.160
What the hell? Now she's getting her packages delivered to my house?!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:32.250
It's probably just another one of those Gadgets of Misfortune, anyway.

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:36.960
In that case, I can get rid of this thing before she even gets her hands on it!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:42.930
It's not gonna explode or anything, is it?

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:45.260
Well, it seems all right.

00:02:46.470 --> 00:02:49.770
Can't wait to see her face when she finds out!

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:53.820
Wh-What the hell?!

00:02:53.820 --> 00:02:55.820
Gotcha, tits-for-brains!

00:02:55.820 --> 00:03:00.530
That's the Aging Box I received from none other than the legendary Urashima Taro himself!

00:03:02.490 --> 00:03:05.990
Urashima Taro became deified as Mizunoe Urashimako, the God of Longevity and Marriage

00:03:05.990 --> 00:03:08.040
who connects the present world and the underworld.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:12.290
Once you become an old woman, it'll be all too easy to suck the Fortune outta you!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:16.250
Despair as your proud tits become saggy lumps of flesh right before your own eyes!

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:20.260
Huh?

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.220
H-Huh?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:32.020
<i>That turtle... he got me the wrong kind of Aging Box!</i>

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:34.360
Actually, this could work.

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.280
I may be small, but I still have the Soumin Shoura—

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:41.900
Oh no! The Soumin Shourai shrank too!

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:43.450
You done?

00:03:44.780 --> 00:03:46.530
This isn't over yet!

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.620
Come, my spirits!

00:03:50.410 --> 00:03:54.130
Goddamn it, they're all kids as well!

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:56.500
You done?

00:03:58.340 --> 00:04:01.920
Just taking your Fortune now would be no fun at all.

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:06.260
I'll make you pay for all the humiliation you've put me though.

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:10.100
So how's it feel, losing that body you were so proud of?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.730
Who's the flat one now, huh? Huh? Huh?!

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:16.360
We look about the same right now, if you ask me...

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:22.200
You kidding me, you goddamned brat?!

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.330
What? A tie?!

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:37.710
There's no way that can be right!

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.380
Don't look at me like that!

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.590
Oh, this fucking pisses me off!

00:04:46.590 --> 00:04:47.470
Keep an eye on her!

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:50.600
I'm gonna go buy some torture devices from the 100 yen store so we can have some fun!

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:55.310
We don't even have a hundred yen? Seriously?!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:59.270
Well, fine. Looks like I'll have to improvise with some stuff from around the hou—

00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:01.230
Huh?

00:05:01.650 --> 00:05:02.070
Hey, you—

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:03.950
Hold it!

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:07.740
Have you lost your mind?!

00:05:14.250 --> 00:05:16.670
Goddamn it! You're not getting away!

00:05:21.630 --> 00:05:24.010
Wait up!

00:05:30.720 --> 00:05:33.850
<i>You gotta be shittin' me! At least give me time to change!</i>

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.520
<i>Wonder if she's still floating around out there.</i>

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.850
<i>Guess I'll hide here for now.</i>

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.730
<i>If she finds me now, it's all over.</i>

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:43.820
Found ya!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:52.620
Mika, what's wrong?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.700
Is this girl your friend?

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.710
Who? Dunno her.

00:05:58.170 --> 00:06:01.090
<i>Who is this kid? "Mika"?</i>

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.500
<i>Mika... Mika...</i>

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.550
<i>Oh! Now I remember!</i>

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:09.010
<i>This kid is Tsuwabuki's little sister!</i>

00:06:09.590 --> 00:06:12.430
Hey, you wanna play hide-and-seek with us?

00:06:12.970 --> 00:06:14.850
C'mon!

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:18.140
Uh... Well, I...

00:06:18.850 --> 00:06:22.230
Uh... Sure! I'll play with you!

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:25.690
Yay! It's okay if she joins us, right?

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:26.990
Sure!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:31.700
Oh yeah, what's your name? I'm Tsuwabuki Mika.

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:33.990
Uh... I'm...

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.450
M-Michiko!

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.200
I'm Michiko!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:39.370
Ichiko!

00:06:39.370 --> 00:06:41.080
Come out, wherever you are!

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:46.420
Geez. If you hadn't broken the scouter, we'd've found her by now.

00:06:46.960 --> 00:06:50.130
It's great that you're enthusiastic, but don't overdo it.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.930
Hm? Oh, they're just normal kids.

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:02.440
Bye-bye! See you tomorrow!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:04.400
Later!

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:07.940
You're not going home, Michiko?

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:12.620
<i>Oh, shit! I made it this far by blending in with the kids,</i>

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:16.040
<i>but people are gonna notice if I'm out on my own this late!</i>

00:07:16.740 --> 00:07:17.370
<i>Oh, wait!</i>

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.580
Hey Mika, I was thinking... I'd sure love to see your house!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.750
My house?

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.750
I can't?

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:29.220
Come on, hear me out!

00:07:29.220 --> 00:07:34.220
I can't go back to my house, and there's nowhere else for me to hide!

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:37.260
And I sure as hell ain't gonna camp out on the streets!

00:07:37.260 --> 00:07:39.390
Sure, no problem!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.190
Really?

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:45.440
Okay, let's go! It's really close.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.200
<i>All right, camping averted!</i>

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:54.240
<i>Now I just have to find a way to return to my normal body.</i>

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:57.950
<i>But I don't even know where to start...</i>

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.830
<i>And I'd need someone who'll understand what's going on...</i>

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:05.540
Let go of me, you freak!

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:09.670
Could you <i>be</i> any more obvious?! I know exactly what you're after!

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.630
What's wrong?

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:14.390
Sorry, Mika, you go on ahead.

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.800
I left something back at the park.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.560
But you don't know the way.

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:21.390
I'll catch up!

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:23.600
Okay, I'll walk slowly then!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:28.270
Get your hands off me, you fuckin' pervert monk!

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.940
No, you've got it all wrong.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:33.990
Huh? This guy's the worst! He used that poor puppy as a shield!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.740
Uh... I'm sorry.

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:38.990
It turned into a person!

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:43.870
That kick of yours is truly divine, miss!
Have you had experience in inflicting pain?

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.500
What's with this guy? This wasn't in the script!

00:08:53.470 --> 00:08:55.340
And another one runs away.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.050
Bobby! Momou!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:58.050
Huh?

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:03.100
Who's this? Someone you know?

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:04.140
No...

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:07.230
It's me! Sakura Ichiko!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:15.400
I dunno who she is, I got no clue what she's talking about.

00:09:15.400 --> 00:09:17.320
Sorry, I'm not into little girls.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:21.450
Seriously. I don't see what's so appealing about chicks with no—

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:25.790
Take this! Even if your mind doesn't get it, your <i>body</i> will remember!

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:29.210
There's no mistaking this technique! It's Sakura Ichiko!

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:33.130
Momou! How could a dog like you not recognize my scent?!

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:35.260
Actually, I knew it from the start!

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:38.640
But to be honest, I kinda hoped this would happen!

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.140
You look so happy, Momou!

00:09:43.270 --> 00:09:45.850
Oh, of course there's a way to return to your normal body.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:47.390
Really?

00:09:47.390 --> 00:09:51.360
There are two types of Aging Boxes, so there should be one that will make you older.

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:53.900
And I can use that to return to normal?

00:09:53.900 --> 00:09:54.900
It should.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:10:00.120
Hey, Bobby, Momou. Would you please find that box for me?

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:02.910
I can't really walk around in public like this.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:07.920
If you find it for me, I'll give you anything you want.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.330
For real?!

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:11.040
I'll do anything to you!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.040
Huh?

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.170
All right! Let's do this, bro!

00:10:17.170 --> 00:10:21.100
I was talking about stuff like money or food! Get your minds out of the gutter!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.890
Miss Ichiko,

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.060
I'll leave this with you.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:26.560
If anything happens, please call us!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.230
What is this? A whistle?

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:33.190
Dog God! It's time to put your money...

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:36.570
...where your mouth is!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:40.780
Asking those two might not have been the best idea.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:42.320
But what choice do I have?

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:46.540
We're here! It's a little small, but...

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.580
I'm back!

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:50.330
<i>Can't believe I'm back </i>here <i>again.</i>

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.710
<i>It beats the streets, but only just.</i>

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:56.880
Oh, you brought a friend?

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:59.050
Nice to meet you. I'm Rika.

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:00.380
She's my sister!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.390
That's my brother Ryuuta.

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:05.850
Ryuu...

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:08.140
And here's my little brother, Sorata.

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:10.020
Sora, say hello!

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:13.520
H-Hello there!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:19.530
<i>He's suspicious of me! Is "child's intuition" even a thing?!</i>

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.580
<i>Right, he's just a kid.</i>

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:28.830
I'm back.

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:30.620
<i>And the boss makes his appearance.</i>

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:32.580
The man of the house!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:37.000
Uh, his name is... a... i... u... e...

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:39.090
It's Keita. Friend of yours?

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.970
Yup! This is Michiko.

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.510
Hello.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:47.470
Hm? Have I met you somewhere?

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:49.980
Must be my imagination.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.770
<i>It's not over yet! The real challenge starts now!</i>

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.650
You want to stay over?

00:11:58.650 --> 00:11:59.650
Yes...

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.030
You should call your parents, at least.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:05.160
No! Well, that's...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:05.910
What?

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:09.500
I... don't have a mom or dad.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.330
In fact, I don't have any family at all, and I don't want to stay at home all alone!

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:14.500
Then I think we'd better let the police handle this.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:15.830
That was a lie!

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:18.630
The truth is, my dad's a really scary person,

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:21.300
and he's always violent with me and my mom.

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.840
That's why I ran away from home!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.090
I'll go set him straight.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.970
That was a lie too!

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:31.980
Can't I just stay here for a little while? Do you really need to know why?

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.850
So you're not gonna tell me, huh?

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.650
Well, no use dragging it out of you.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.320
Our bathroom stinks, just letting you know.

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:39.980
Thank you very much!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:41.860
I'll definitely pay you back!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:43.280
Yeah, yeah...

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.990
<i>Wait a sec! Could she be the daughter of some rich family?!</i>

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.790
Thank you very much. This is our thanks.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:56.830
For real?! With this we could buy a house, a soccer ball, some clothes...

00:12:56.830 --> 00:12:58.840
Thanks, Keita!

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:03.340
Just a little longer, guys! Just hang in there a little longer!

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.590
Why're you crying?

00:13:05.130 --> 00:13:07.340
Thanks for the food!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:10.810
Mika! Your shrimp is bigger than mine!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:12.220
So what?

00:13:12.220 --> 00:13:16.350
How many times have I told you to not point your chopsticks at each other?!

00:13:16.940 --> 00:13:19.650
Sorry we're so loud, Michiko.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.610
<i>It's almost scary how little they've changed.</i>

00:13:22.610 --> 00:13:26.780
We had a guest over for dinner once before, didn't we?

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.410
Yeah, when Tittyko was here.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:31.120
<i>Ryuuta, are you still saying that?!</i>

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:35.830
That's right. That awful girl.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:38.330
What the hell was her problem?

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.790
She just shows up at our house,
well I don't really mind that she came,

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:42.590
but then she treats us all like fools,

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.630
or rather, like the dirt beneath her feet,

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:47.430
and what gives her the right? Just because she has a bit of money?!

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:49.640
Rika's gone into sister-in-law mode.

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:52.390
We shouldn't even talk about that girl.

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.640
You're gonna get wrinkles.

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:57.560
I'm only in seventh grade!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:01.230
Let's just drop it.

00:14:01.230 --> 00:14:02.940
Crap, is that the time?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:04.940
I gotta get to work.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:06.490
Already?

00:14:06.490 --> 00:14:09.240
I've got tomorrow off, so let's do something fun.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.200
Really?

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:11.830
Yay!

00:14:11.830 --> 00:14:13.240
I'm off, then.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.660
Take care!

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:16.790
What's tomorrow?

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:18.580
A picnic!

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.290
Michiko, you should come too.

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.290
Huh?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.300
Yeah! Let's go!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:25.800
Yay!

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.430
This is gonna be so much fun!

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:33.260
What's with this place? It feels just like it did last time!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:38.730
I came here to hide, but it's so suffocating!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:45.650
Why? Why do I feel so... irritated?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:50.030
I can feel it, Dog God!

00:14:50.030 --> 00:14:50.660
What?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.540
Maybe we'll be able to find a clue within <i>this</i> fine establishment!

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:56.580
What're you talking about?! We have to go in <i>here</i>!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.960
Heh heh... This is kind of exciting!

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:00.960
You're starting to piss me off.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.970
Like I said,

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:20.060
if you hadn't gotten the Aging Boxes mixed up,
this wouldn't have happened in the first place!

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:24.270
Oh, don't say that. It's not my fault she got aw—

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.270
Shut up!

00:15:26.070 --> 00:15:28.650
What should I do, then?

00:15:28.650 --> 00:15:31.280
Please prepare more Aging Boxes as soon as possible.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.410
One to return her to normal, and another to turn her into an old hag.

00:15:34.410 --> 00:15:35.740
What?!

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.740
No way, no way, no way!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:40.960
Do you know what I had to go through just to get one of those?

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.370
And you want <i>two</i>?!

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:44.210
Otohime's damn scary when she's mad, you know!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:46.960
Fine, I get it. Forget it.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:53.010
But you'd better be ready for the next time we meet.

00:15:53.550 --> 00:15:58.600
I hear thousand-year-old turtles make <i>delicious</i> soup.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.350
No way! Are you serious?!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.190
Fine, I get it! I'll get them somehow!

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:04.860
Just give me a week!

00:16:04.860 --> 00:16:07.820
Three days! Any longer and you're soup!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:16.990
Though, all the Aging Boxes in the world won't do any good if we can't find her.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:21.210
Aw, c'mon! Where'd you run off to, Ichiko?

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:29.130
Oh, that's right. There's only one place she <i>could</i> have gone.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:35.140
Ah, looks like the perfect day for a picnic.

00:16:35.590 --> 00:16:39.430
Huh? Who wet the bed?

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.770
Michiko.

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.560
That so?

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.520
I'm sorry.

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:52.110
<i>I might have a child's body, but I didn't realize it'd come with a child's bladder as well...</i>

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:57.620
There's no need to apologize, Michiko. We can just wash the futon.

00:16:58.030 --> 00:17:03.000
<i>I'm sixteen years old, yet I still... Still...</i>

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.250
Michiko?

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.800
Don't cry, Michiko!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:20.600
<i>How dare she subject me to this humiliation?!</i>

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:24.430
<i>Once I get my body back, you're fucking dead, God of Misfortune!</i>

00:17:27.600 --> 00:17:30.020
Found ya.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:36.410
La-la-la-la, going on a picnic!

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.030
I see, so you're all siblings?

00:17:41.030 --> 00:17:43.250
Yes. We're going up to the Glistening Plateau.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:45.410
D'you think there'll be rhinoceros beetles?

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.620
Of course.

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:57.430
La-la, la-la...

00:17:57.880 --> 00:18:02.930
A very fun picnic...

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:06.600
We made it!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:14.780
Here you go!

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:19.530
<i>Everyone's so fit. I'm no slouch myself, but damn.</i>

00:18:19.870 --> 00:18:22.200
Ah, Michiko, heads up!

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:22.700
Huh?

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.580
Michiko!

00:18:28.040 --> 00:18:30.170
You okay, Michiko?

00:18:30.170 --> 00:18:31.840
Hey, watch where you throw that thing!

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:35.380
Here, wipe yourself off.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.760
<i>Oh, a handkerchief. Didn't expect that.</i>

00:18:39.720 --> 00:18:42.390
<i>Whoa, he wrote his address on it?!</i>

00:18:42.390 --> 00:18:44.390
<i>What a skinflint...</i>

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.640
If Mika had a tumble like that, she'd be sobbing.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:52.150
But you're not crying at all.

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.520
You're a tough girl, Michiko.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.200
D-Don't treat me like a kid!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:01.200
Keita!

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:06.410
I think I made her angry.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:08.910
Seriously. What'd you say to her?

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:14.800
Damn it, what's wrong with me?

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:20.380
It's him. When I look at him... I just get so irritated!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.680
Is it because he keeps treating me like a child?

00:19:24.430 --> 00:19:25.930
I don't know!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.060
Wow! Real squirrels!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:36.110
Huh? One of them's huge...

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:43.200
Teddy?!

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:48.160
Aha! I've got you now!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:54.040
I've done it! Ranger Momiji has discovered a new species!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.670
G-God of Misfortune!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.170
Oh, how I've waited for this chance.

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.840
For you to be separated from Tsuwabuki and the others.

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:07.470
<i>I even brought the Soumin Shourai, just in case!</i>

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:10.180
<i>But it's in my backpack, along with Momou's whistle!</i>

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:11.730
<i>Goddamn it! </i>

00:20:12.810 --> 00:20:16.770
Michiko, where are ya? Time to go back!

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:19.230
Michiko!

00:20:19.230 --> 00:20:22.280
What do we do? What if she really got lost?

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:25.820
Man, all cause Keita made her mad.

00:20:26.660 --> 00:20:27.740
Ryuu! Stop it!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:33.620
Anyway, Rika, you go down first with the kids before it gets dark.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:37.090
Wait by the Tozanguchi bus station.

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:40.460
Michiko might have already gone there.

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:41.470
But...

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:45.970
I'll leave Ryuu, Mika and Sora with you.

00:20:49.260 --> 00:20:51.850
Keita! Be careful!

00:20:52.270 --> 00:20:54.270
Yeah! Don't worry!

00:20:56.310 --> 00:20:57.610
Michiko!

00:20:59.270 --> 00:21:01.400
Oi, Michiko!

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:05.410
Damn, should I call a search party?

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:07.660
Huh? What's that?

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:13.410
It's Michiko's shoe... but where's the other one?

00:21:15.000 --> 00:21:16.170
N-No way...

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.000
She didn't fall down... Did she?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:26.130
<i>You kiddin' me?</i>

00:22:58.980 --> 00:23:01.650
I can feel it! There's a clue within these walls!

00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:02.940
What're you talking about?! It's over here!

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:04.860
By the way, what were we looking for again?

00:23:04.860 --> 00:23:05.980
Don't ask me!

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:08.990
This week's <i>Nadeshiko ga!</i>

00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:11.570
Thanks for waiting, everyone!

00:23:11.570 --> 00:23:14.950
It's me again, that loudmouthed girl who steals away your time each episode!

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:16.950
You know, the one that has no real relation to the show

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:21.000
but takes up the time and effort of the
animators and staff every week! Yes, me!

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:23.630
This week I'm here, and here!

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:25.840
They say to one another, colleague to colleague,

00:23:25.840 --> 00:23:29.840
"Huh? This girl's not even in the manga, so why's she even here?"

00:23:29.840 --> 00:23:34.930
Those pencil-pushing plebs working on this show can all go to hell!
